{
 "file": "06BLK04K base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:1f",
   "ptr": "0x1f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「すまなかったな、兵隊に見つかるとヤ\\n",
   "en": "\"Sorry about that. If the soldiers found us, we'd be in trouble.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:48",
   "ptr": "0x48",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  バイんでね」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:1f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:5e",
   "ptr": "0x5e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「いやいや、すごかったねェ、さっきの\\n",
   "en": "\"Whoa, that was something, that fight just now! Haven't got that fired up in ages!\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:87",
   "ptr": "0x87",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  立ち回り！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:98",
   "ptr": "0x98",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　ひさしぶりに熱くなったよ！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  立ち回り！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:5e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:c1",
   "ptr": "0xc1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「戒厳令だの何だの言われるほど、酒を\\n",
   "en": "\"The more they go on about martial law and whatnot, the more a man wants a drink. Human nature, that is.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:ea",
   "ptr": "0xea",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  飲みたくなるのが人情ってもんさ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:c1"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:117",
   "ptr": "0x117",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「関所の衛兵をやっつけたのって、あな\\n",
   "en": "\"It was you who beat up",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:140",
   "ptr": "0x140",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  たでしょ？」",
   "en": "the Checkpoint guards, wasn't it?\"",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:15b",
   "ptr": "0x15b",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「強いのね？　素敵よ蠢」\\f",
   "en": "\"So you're strong, hm? You're wonderful!\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:17b",
   "ptr": "0x17b",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "「な～んだ・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Aww, what... All show and no go, huh?\"",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:190",
   "ptr": "0x190",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　見かけ倒しじゃん」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:17b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:1b8",
   "ptr": "0x1b8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ドラールとマッカロックは壊滅したん\\n",
   "en": "\"Dral and Maccaloc were destroyed, weren't they? ...Come on, you can't hide it from me.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:1e1",
   "ptr": "0x1e1",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  でしょう？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:1b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:1f2",
   "ptr": "0x1f2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・な～に、隠したって分かります\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  でしょう？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:1b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:21b",
   "ptr": "0x21b",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  よ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:1b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:227",
   "ptr": "0x227",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　こんな山の上にある街で出入口を塞い\\n",
   "en": "You'd think that if you blocked the gates of a city up on a mountain like this, the folks inside would stay in the dark, but...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:250",
   "ptr": "0x250",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  じまえば、中にいる奴は、何も知らな\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:227"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:279",
   "ptr": "0x279",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  いままだろうと思っても・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:227"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:29d",
   "ptr": "0x29d",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　いろいろと方法はあるもんでね。\\n",
   "en": "there are all sorts of ways. Like sending letters by bird or beast...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:2c2",
   "ptr": "0x2c2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　例えば、鳥や動物を使って手紙を送る\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:29d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:2eb",
   "ptr": "0x2eb",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  とか・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:29d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:2fd",
   "ptr": "0x2fd",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　関所の衛兵を買収するとか・・・\\n",
   "en": "Or bribing the Checkpoint guards... Those guys can't resist money.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:322",
   "ptr": "0x322",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　奴ら、金に目がないし。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:2fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:340",
   "ptr": "0x340",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ま、いずれにしても、こういう話は噂\\n",
   "en": "Well, either way, talk like this gets around, so sooner or later the whole town will know.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:369",
   "ptr": "0x369",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  になるから、そのうち、街中の人間が\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:340"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:392",
   "ptr": "0x392",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  知ることになるでしょうよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:340"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:3b6",
   "ptr": "0x3b6",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「人の口に戸は立てられませんよ」\\f",
   "en": "\"You can't shut people's mouths, you know.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:3e9",
   "ptr": "0x3e9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「この前、遺跡調査に反対した人たちが\\n",
   "en": "\"Back when those people against the ruins survey were arrested, even the magic-users and fortune-tellers got hauled off...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:412",
   "ptr": "0x412",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  捕まった時、魔法使いや占い師まで引っ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:3e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:43d",
   "ptr": "0x43d",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  張られて行ったのは・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:3e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:45d",
   "ptr": "0x45d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　今にして思えば、情報統制って意図も\\n",
   "en": "Thinking back now, I get the feeling it was also meant to control information.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:486",
   "ptr": "0x486",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  あった気がするな。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:45d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:4a0",
   "ptr": "0x4a0",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　街の外で何かが起これば、真っ先に、\\n",
   "en": "If something happens outside the city, folks like that are the first to notice. Some of them can see all kinds of things in a crystal ball, after all.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:4c9",
   "ptr": "0x4c9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  そういう連中が気付くからね。水晶玉\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:4a0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:4f2",
   "ptr": "0x4f2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  を通して、いろんなものを見ることの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:4a0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:51b",
   "ptr": "0x51b",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  できる奴もいるわけだし。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:4a0"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:53b",
   "ptr": "0x53b",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　・・・なんだか、城の貴族たちは、\\n",
   "en": "...Seems the nobles in the castle really don't want us knowing anything. Thinking about it that way...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:562",
   "ptr": "0x562",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  よっぽどおれたちに、何も知られたく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:53b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:58b",
   "ptr": "0x58b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ないみたいだな。そう考えると・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:53b"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:5b5",
   "ptr": "0x5b5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　関所を封鎖したのは、魔物から街を守\\n",
   "en": "maybe they sealed the Checkpoint not to guard the city from monsters, but to keep us townsfolk shut in?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:5de",
   "ptr": "0x5de",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  るためでなく、おれたち住民を閉じこ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:5b5"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:607",
   "ptr": "0x607",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  めておくためだったような？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:5b5"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:629",
   "ptr": "0x629",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　・・・・・・\\n",
   "en": "...... ...Nah, that's overthinking it, surely.\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:63c",
   "ptr": "0x63c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・いや、いくらなんでも考えすぎ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:629"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:665",
   "ptr": "0x665",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  だな、そりゃ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:629"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:67d",
   "ptr": "0x67d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「住民を街に閉じこめたって、何の得に\\n",
   "en": "\"Locking the townsfolk in wouldn't gain them anything, would it?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:6a6",
   "ptr": "0x6a6",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  もならんよな」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:67d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:6c8",
   "ptr": "0x6c8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ここに集まってるのは、兵隊に斬られ\\n",
   "en": "\"Everyone in here's a fool who'd drink even if the soldiers cut 'em down for it. You folks the same?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:6f1",
   "ptr": "0x6f1",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  てもいいから、酒が飲みたいって馬鹿\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:6c8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:71a",
   "ptr": "0x71a",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  ばっかりだ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:6c8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:72d",
   "ptr": "0x72d",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　あんたらも、そうかね？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ばっかりだ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:6c8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:754",
   "ptr": "0x754",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「あんた、見張りの兵士を残らず斬って\\n",
   "en": "\"You cut down every last one of the soldiers on watch, didn't you?",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:77d",
   "ptr": "0x77d",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  くれたろ？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:754"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:78f",
   "ptr": "0x78f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　・・・いや、いいんだいいんだ。\\n",
   "en": "...No, no, it's fine, it's fine. Do more of it. Does my heart good.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:7b4",
   "ptr": "0x7b4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もっと、やってくれ。清々するから。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK04K:78f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:7de",
   "ptr": "0x7de",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　ま、これで美味い酒でも飲んでくれや。\\n",
   "en": "Here, have yourself some good liquor with this. A little gift from me.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK04K:809",
